Hi all,

I just released lm-sensors 3.0.3.

Important changes compared to lm-sensors 3.0.2:
* pwmconfig has been improved a lot. There's still a long way to go
  (probably including a rewrite in a different language) before it
  qualifies as user-friendly.
* sensors-detect knows of a dozen additional devices and was made more
  reliable for another half dozen.

Phil, please copy the new files to your mirror, thanks.

